The '''Lola Sayu system''' was a [[star system]] that was located in the [[Belderone sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Ultimate SW" /> The system contained the [[planet]] [[Lola Sayu]] as well as a single [[star]].<ref name="The Citadel" /> It was located near the intersection of the [[Perlemian Trade Route]] and the [[Salin Corridor]],<ref name="BMF 75" /> but not directly on either [[hyperspace route]].<ref name="Map">{{StarWarsGalaxyMap}}</ref>

